/**
 * connector-packs-fresh.test.ts — A2A dev-request
 * 2026-10-16-merkevare-entitet-og-connector-pakker, G3-S6.
 *
 * The Claude directory packs in {rfb,opplevagent,dental}-connectors-prep/ are
 * generated by scripts/gen-connector-packs.ts. This test fails when a pack on
 * disk disagrees with the generator or with its sources. Groups, by prefix:
 *   (a) freshness, determinism (no timestamps), PAYMENTS_ENABLED and CRLF;
 *   (b) tool names, count, titles and annotations against the registration;
 *   (c) catalog claims equal the floor; no old figures in the three folders;
 *   (d) brand URLs and support e-mail from brand-entities, and no others;
 *   (e) claude.ai/directory/manage from Pro or Max, no Team-org premise;
 *   (f) prerequisite rows per vertical and the derived ones against the code
 *       (descriptions, terms, docs, icon, screenshots against the card
 *       templates, dental McpServer setup), plus renderPack() on synthetic
 *       input for each rule, negative cases included;
 *   (g) icon md5 pinned per brand, 512×512, no foreign icons;
 *   (h) listing counts and limits, reviewer prompts, write-tool warnings;
 *   (i) the MCPB path marked deprecated;
 *   (j) protocol versions from the SDK and the data-handling paste block;
 *   (k) the dental pack says no more than the service does (the independent
 *       check of the directory prompt, 2026-10-19): emergency care per place
 *       (a known town gives its county; since S8 of A2A dev-request
 *       2026-10-16-tannlege-mcp-instrukser-og-klinikkort any other place is
 *       read as that place, as tannlege_search reads it), no
 *       out-of-hours promise but /vilkar's 113 line and advice, Helfo as read
 *       automatically from the clinic's own website; and the readiness line
 *       points at no table portal-answers.md lacks (S10). G3-S6d (lokal#1201
 *       round 3): emergency care is the clinic's own word and no «emergency
 *       duty» without the stored quote (F1-S4c), «more than 4,500 clinics»,
 *       only the caveats that hold, and the portal's real fields: three use
 *       cases with example prompts within its limits, «Consumer Health», and
 *       «Use only if the portal asks» on the texts it has no field for.
 *
 * Run standalone: npx tsx src/routes/connector-packs-fresh.test.ts
 * Wired into `npm test` via tests/test.ts.
 */

